      "sourceTextSha256": "ac84f63a6092d1dc7f3f7ba1369cf32df2ab8e442127ae1463d53e369cf96bb1",
      "text": "After breakfast, an early departure from Cuiabá for Porto Jofre, the gateway to the Northern Pantanal, along a scenic road that shows the transition from savanna to wetlands. In the afternoon, your first boat safari from the lodge, gliding along the rivers to spot herons, caimans and a wide variety of birdlife, in one of the richest wildlife areas of South America. Overnight at the Santa Rosa Lodge, with lunch and dinner.",
